er track of who I've been in touch with lately — I messaged Galina today, could you log that for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0018\", \"v\": [[\"um, can you log that I… I messaged Galina Synett today?\", \"oh and, uh, can you square up my flint fund balance with Priziel?\", \"okay so, move the Njal task to sunday and, um, the daffodil viewing to next monday\", \"hmm, is there anything in my calendar at Vrimford Cove?\"], [\"I've been terrible at keeping up with people, so just for the record — I messaged Galina Synett today. Can you log that?\", \"Different thing, I hate having money hanging over me, so could you square my flint fund balance with Priziel?\", \"My weekend's getting a bit crowded, so could you move the Njal task to sunday and push the daffodil viewing to next monday?\", \"I was trying to remember whether I'd planned anything out there — is there a calendar event at Vrimford Cove?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0019\", \"v\": [[\"files mentioning hoop?\"], [\"which files mention hoop\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0020\", \"v\": [[\"umm, does Wojciech owe me… anything?\", \"and, uh, what about Enou Gokhale?\"], [\"I'm trying to work out who still owes me before the month really gets going — does Wojciech owe me anything?\", \"Okay, and Enou Gokhale? Same question, I've honestly lost track there too.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0021\", \"v\": [[\"do i have any bellflower photos\"], [\"Could you check whether I have any photos of bellflower, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0022\", \"v\": [[\"whats the last thing i wrote in my journal\"], [\"Could you please tell me what the most recent thing I wrote in my journal was?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0023\", \"v\": [[\"three hour jobs on my list?\"], [\"um, what are the… the three hour jobs on my list?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0024\", \"v\": [[\"note to self: measure the organ\", \"move daffodil repair to wednesday at 10am\", \"no, wrong one — trumpet sale\", \"who's coming to it?\", \"tick off ask njal\"], [\"Before I forget, since I need to know whether it'll fit through the door — note to self: measure the organ.\", \"My plans have shifted a bit, so could you move the daffodil repair appointment to wednesday at 10am?\", \"Oh no, sorry, that was the wrong event — I actually meant the trumpet sale one, that's the one that needed moving.\", \"Thanks — and while we're on it, who's coming to that one? I'd like to know how many people to expect.\", \"Different thing, I finally got round to it, so can you tick off the ask njal task?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0026\", \"v\": [[\"uh, when's Treskan's birthday again?\"], [\"I want to get a card in the post in good time this year, so when is Treskan's birthday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0027\", \"v\": [[\"um, when's my coffee with Treskan?\", \"ah, nah… just leave it.\"], [\"Could you tell me when my coffee with Treskan is, please?\", \"Ah, never mind — please just leave it as it is, thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0028\", \"v\": [[\"how much I owe Wojciech?\"], [\"how much do i owe Wojciech rn\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0029\", \"v\": [[\"how much did i spend back in June\", \"nvm\", \"get rid of every wishlist note pls\", \"ok just delete the wishlist note then\", \"also remove the sunrise pic\", \"wait i didnt mean that, bring it back\"], [\"Could you tell me how much I spent back in June?\", \"Never mind, thank you.\", \"Would you please get rid of every wishlist note?\", \"Could you delete the wishlist note, please?\", \"Would you mind removing the sunrise photo?\", \"Oh, I'm sorry, I didn't mean that — could you bring it back, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0030\", \"v\": [[\"note down: gift ideas for Wulan\", \"where am i at with Wusia in the Dalat trip\", \"whos coming to the Lakshmi\", \"who else is coming apart from Galina\", \"whats my latest journal entry\"], [\"note: gift ideas for Wulan\", \"me and Wusia, Dalat trip?\", \"who's coming to the Lakshmi?\", \"others besides Galina?\", \"latest journal entry\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0031\", \"v\": [[\"We're finally back and I want the 